{"3875550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fritz - Dein Schachtrainer 2", "steam_appid": 3875550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I am FRITZ and have been redefining the world of chess for over 30 years. </strong>Whether in New York against Garry Kasparov or in Bonn in a 4:2 victory against the then world champion Vladimir Kramnik, millions of chess fans followed my ‘man versus machine’ duels. And even after 30 years, I'm still in top form: in 2023, I won the official chess software world championship and in 2024, I was runner-up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, I can also play differently. With my AI-supported help function, even beginners can play brilliant winning games against me: you get tips for every move via text and audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New: Compete against legends! Measure yourself against the great masters of chess history: Morphy, Lasker, Capablanca, Tal, Fischer, Karpov – with playing strength tailored to you, but in authentic style. The unique style engine simulates their playing style as convincingly as only FRITZ can. And fun is guaranteed: I provide intelligent commentary on the games! And of course you can choose the board design: 7 brilliantly designed boards in 2D and 3D are available. And if you want to get even better: Tactical training with ever-changing tasks for checkmating and winning material!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need even more excitement? Want to play games against other people? No problem: your new chess buddy FRITZ will find you opponents on the Playchess chess server at any time. I'm not just a normal trainer, I'm FRITZ, the unexpected new dimension of chess! Now on your PC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Fritz offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play chess against Fritz in 7 game levels from hobby player to world-class player!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 virtual opponents: Morphy, Lasker, Capablanca, Tal, Fischer, Karpov</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The AI-supported help function provides intelligent hints and tips via text and audio</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live internet games against opponents on  (4 time controls to choose from)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics training: exercises for checkmating and winning material</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Fritz opening book with lots of theoretical knowledge</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fritz – AI provides witty and biting audio commentary.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Fritz 2D chess boards and 5 photo-realistic 3D chess boards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save/load games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of achievements for good moves</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports Xbox controllers</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I am FRITZ and have been redefining the world of chess for over 30 years. </strong>Whether in New York against Garry Kasparov or in Bonn in a 4:2 victory against the then world champion Vladimir Kramnik, millions of chess fans followed my ‘man versus machine’ duels. And even after 30 years, I'm still in top form: in 2023, I won the official chess software world championship and in 2024, I was runner-up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, I can also play differently. With my AI-supported help function, even beginners can play brilliant winning games against me: you get tips for every move via text and audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New: Compete against legends! Measure yourself against the great masters of chess history: Morphy, Lasker, Capablanca, Tal, Fischer, Karpov – with playing strength tailored to you, but in authentic style. The unique style engine simulates their playing style as convincingly as only FRITZ can. And fun is guaranteed: I provide intelligent commentary on the games! And of course you can choose the board design: 7 brilliantly designed boards in 2D and 3D are available. And if you want to get even better: Tactical training with ever-changing tasks for checkmating and winning material!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need even more excitement? Want to play games against other people? No problem: your new chess buddy FRITZ will find you opponents on the Playchess chess server at any time. I'm not just a normal trainer, I'm FRITZ, the unexpected new dimension of chess! Now on your PC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Fritz offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play chess against Fritz in 7 game levels from hobby player to world-class player!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 virtual opponents: Morphy, Lasker, Capablanca, Tal, Fischer, Karpov</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The AI-supported help function provides intelligent hints and tips via text and audio</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live internet games against opponents on  (4 time controls to choose from)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics training: exercises for checkmating and winning material</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Fritz opening book with lots of theoretical knowledge</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fritz – AI provides witty and biting audio commentary.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Fritz 2D chess boards and 5 photo-realistic 3D chess boards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save/load games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of achievements for good moves</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports Xbox controllers</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fritz. Your chess trainer! Chess is fun with me! With AI help you learn to play brilliant winning games even as a beginner. Or play at professional level without help. Always with a humorous commentary. I also find opponents for you on the chess server and give you tactics training.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875550/776dfe91618f4fc33e8951135685ae12ff8325e7/header.jpg?t=1770374728", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875550/6e6ead000adbb942d3f66a817f6e2c8c480a9afb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770374728", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875550/6e6ead000adbb942d3f66a817f6e2c8c480a9afb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770374728", "website": "https://chessbase.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla